0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.2338772338772339, "x1": 0.6010989010989011, "y1": 0.24708624708624707}, {"text": "\u00a9 use language appropriate to audience, purpose and form to shape meaning", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2540792540792541, "x1": 0.7681318681318682, "y1": 0.26728826728826727}, {"text": "Question 8 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.29914529914529914, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "Compose a piece of imaginative writing that i:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.32944832944832947, "x1": 0.4901098901098901, "y1": 0.34887334887334887}, {"text": "t in a significant place.", "x0": 0.521978021978022, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.7043956043956044, "y1": 0.3457653457653458}, {"text": "Begin with the words:", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.36596736596736595, "x1": 0.2967032967032967, "y1": 0.3791763791763792}, {"text": "This is my world now, and it can be yours too, if you like. A place can soak", "x0": 0.16593406593406593, "y0": 0.39937839937839936, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.4125874125874126}, {"text": "through your skin like sweat, and ooze into your heart and soul. Breathe it in,", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.4156954156954157, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.4289044289044289}, {"text": "and let me tell you a story.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.43356643356643354, "x1": 0.3824175824175824, "y1": 0.445998445998446}, {"text": "\u2018Breathe Me In\u2019 by Sophie L Macdonald", "x0": 0.5758241758241758, "y0": 0.4553224553224553, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.46464646464646464}, {"text": "Extract from Underdog by Tobias Madden", "x0": 0.5615384615384615, "y0": 0.466977466977467, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.4763014763014763}, {"text": "with courtesy of Tobias Madden", "x0": 0.6208791208791209, "y0": 0.47863247863247865, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.48795648795648794}, {"text": "Note: You are NOT required to write out the extract as part of your response.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5019425019425019, "x1": 0.7472527472527473, "y1": 0.5151515151515151}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44285714285714284, "y0": 0.5687645687645687, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.581973581973582}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3543123543123543, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}, {"text": "(\u00a9 2020 NSW Edueation Standards", "x0": 0.3824175824175824, "y0": 0.9673659673659674, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.9735819735819736}]]